  message: "Fixed in PR #2455. Added 'pyo3' to _PYO3_ANNOTATIONS frozenset. The Rust analyzer stores annotations with name='pyo3' (crate name), not 'pyfunction'/'pymethods'. 809 of 1823 Rust symbols in tokenizers have pyo3 annotations that will now be matched."  # 7657
